<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/equitable-co-design> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Co-design that deliberately lowers barriers to participation, includes underrepresented perspectives, accounts for intersecting identities and needs, and gives practitioners or users meaningful influence over design decisions." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/equitable-co-design/versions/1> .
