<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/equitable-co-design> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Equitable co-design treats participation, accessibility, autonomy, and representation as design conditions rather than as checks performed after a technology has been built." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/equitable-co-design/versions/1> .
